    "updated_at": "2026-09-15T12:52:58Z",
    "body": "It would be good to figure out something here, as right now there is a check in [the event handler processing algorithm](https://html.spec.whatwg.org/multipage/webappapis.html#the-event-handler-processing-algorithm) but not for event listeners in general.\r\n\r\nThis means that per spec, e.g., `el.onload = foo` will not execute `foo`, but `el.addEventListener(\"load\", foo)` will execute it. Which is bizarre.",
